        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: KKWQ-FM, KRWB (AM)\n- Companies: Border Broadcasting\n- Places: Warroad, Minnesota, Northwest Angle, Angle Township, Lake of the Woods County, Minnesota\n\nFacts:\n- The Northwest Angle is a part of northern Lake of the Woods County, Minnesota, and it is coextensive with Angle Township.\n- Locals refer to the Northwest Angle simply as the Angle.\n- KKWQ-FM 92.5 is a small local radio station broadcasting from Warroad, Minnesota.\n- Border Broadcasting owns and operates KRWB (AM) and its sister station KKWQ-FM.",
